OL,3,GNEWSAFive people killed in wrong-way
OL,4,Acrash with PCs named
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two officers who died, PC Matthew
OL,7,FBlades, 37, and PC Tom Clough, 38, have
OL,8,Fbeen remembered as "brave officers
OL,9,Fprotecting our communities" in what has
OL,10,Fbeen described as an "unimaginable
OL,11,Floss".
OL,13,FThe BBC understands a police pursuit of
OL,14,Fthe car had ended before the crash,
OL,15,Fwith the police vehicle involved in the
OL,16,Fcrash just happening to be in the South
OL,17,FBank area.
